{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t強颱風「薔琵」暴風圈籠罩台灣，為當地帶來狂風大雨，最少1人死亡，超過170人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n在台東富岡漁港，有吊車被巨浪沖落海。大浪又將一名騎電單車的老翁沖倒。全台21個縣市停工停課，逾970班航班取消。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n日本沖繩石垣島亦感受到 「薔琵」的威力，當地近2000戶沒有電力供應，來往石垣、宮古和沖繩本島數十航班被取消。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.883065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:25:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:39:25.304453+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:34.384044+00:00","content_hash":"9feb7019dbfe9c72b4a9c8b99617a093c1827363e15f034598abe111eb89efc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}